# {{PROJECT_NAME}} — project overview

Keep this file under ~200 words. Rename to `project-overview.mdc` after editing.

## Layout

- **`{{BACKEND_DIR}}/`** — API / backend
- **`{{FRONTEND_DIR}}/`** — client / frontend

## Agent team

Open the workspace at the monorepo root so `.cursor/rules/` and `.cursor/skills/` apply.

- Start unclear tasks with `@router-agent`
- Specialists: `@master-agent`, `@backend-agent`, `@frontend-agent`, `@devops-agent`
- Each agent reads its `ROLE.md` + `STATE.md` (Brain snapshot first)

## URLs

- Prod: `{{PROD_URL}}`
- Health: `{{HEALTH_URL}}`
- Local API: `http://localhost:{{LOCAL_PORT}}`

## Invariants (examples — replace with yours)

- Do not invent product scoring / pricing numbers — cite the product spec
- Child/parent (or other domain) rules belong in a dedicated product rule, not here
- Never commit secrets (`.env`, keys, tokens)
